Basic commands:
    Images commands:
        1) pull(download images)
            docker pull ubuntu

        2) remove images
            docker rmi <ImageID>

        3) Check all images
            docker images

    Container commands:
        1) Current running containers
            docker ps

        2) To create container
            docker run <ImageName>

        3) docker start <ContainerName>
           docker run -it <ContainerName>

        4) docker stop <ContainerName>

        5) docker system df

        6) docker system prune -f



    Create Network
        1) docker network create  grid
        2) docker run -d -p 4442-4444:4444 --net grid --name selenium-hub selenium/hub
        3) docker run -d --net grid -e SE_EVENT_BUS_HOST=selenium-hub -e SE_EVENT_BUS_PUBLISH_PORT=4442 -e SE_EVENT_BUS_SUBSCRIBE_PORT=4443 selenium/node-chrome:4
        4) docker run -d --net grid -e SE_EVENT_BUS_HOST=selenium-hub -e SE_EVENT_BUS_PUBLISH_PORT=4442 -e SE_EVENT_BUS_SUBSCRIBE_PORT=4443 selenium/node-firefox
